<title>USA: Philip Morris sets $500 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Philip Morris sets $500 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Philip Morris Cos Inc was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>BORROWER PHILIP MORRIS COS INC</p>
<p>AMT $500 MLN	 COUPON 7.20 PCT   MATURITY 2/01/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.696  FIRST PAY DATE 8/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 7.243 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 78 BPS     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
